Current Version can be found [[Temmie Statue|here]].
[[File:Temmie Statue (Beta 31.0).png|thumb|226x226px|Beta 31.0]]
While Temmie Statue was released in '''Beta 9.0 '''as a 0/7 Disarmed monster, '''Beta 9.1''' already removed its Disarmed. '''Beta 14.0''', while dropping its cost from 5G to 4G, nerfed it with -1 HP and its effect giving summoned [[:Category:Tem|Tems]] +1/+1 instead of +2/+2. '''Beta 18.1''' buffed it a bit by futher lowering its cost to 3G. '''Beta 28.0''' brought it back to 4G, but also returned the +2 ATK of its ability, making it now give +2/+1 to any Tem you summon (the same stats as [[Temmie]] itself). It also gained +1 ATK itself, but it lost that in '''Beta 31.0'''.
[[File:Temmie Statue (Beta 31.2).png|thumb|226x226px|Beta 31.2]]
'''Beta 31.2''' reworked it slightly. Bringing its cost back up to its original 5G, its effect is now stronger or weaker depending on the kind of Tem you summon. [[Bob]] and Temmie 2, the Tems with Haste, gain an increased boost of +2/+2. All other Tems gain a decreased boost of +1/+1. '''Beta 43.0''' gave it its 1 ATK back. '''Beta 55.0''' returned its cost to 3G, but gave it another -1 HP and returned its effect to affect every ally Tem equally, now giving them simply +2 ATK. '''Beta 55.1''' changed this back to +1/+1.
[[File:Temmie Statue (Beta 43.0).png|thumb|221x221px|Beta 43.0]]

